#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658904"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659008"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659144"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659188"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659328"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659448"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659548"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659740"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659804"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659884"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660000"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660128"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660172"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660300"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660428"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660536"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660624"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660716"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660864"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660948"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661080"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661180"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661340"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661468"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661560"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661692"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661792"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662000"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662124"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662256"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662348"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662472"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662552"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662656"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662744"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "662864"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "662948"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "663028"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "663096"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "663136"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "663168"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663200"
msgid "This is the center of #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's mind…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663260"
msgid "A world filled with an anguish that no one\nunderstands, and a sense of hopelessness\nthat no one tries to see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663372"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF has a blank look on her face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663432"
msgid "Her passiveness has vanished,\nand now she's resolved to let no one pass―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663512"
msgid "I sense her madness, to let no one who enters leave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663568"
msgid "…if you had stayed in that school…\nI was always watching you…\nI liked it that way, I was happy, and yet…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "663680"
msgid "Lip and I are enemies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663704"
msgid "Enemies… We're enemies……?\nWhat do you mean―that's…\nThat's a convenient excuse……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663792"
msgid "Lies…!\nIf that were true,\nthen why did you reject me so many times…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663864"
msgid "What should I have done…? If I could have\nforgotten, everything would be fine… but an AI\nlike me has no \"forget\" function…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663992"
msgid "Are you saying there's something\nwrong with me…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664044"
msgid "Something wrong, huh?\nPraetor, it's her compassion.\nTell it to her straight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664124"
msgid "Obviously her body is one issue, but anyway…\nAnswer her, Master. It seems that she won't\nget it unless you say it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664240"
msgid "Does this girl even see a reflection in mirrors?\nRegardless, you need to be clear, Darling!\nBe sincere when you flat out reject her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664376"
msgid "Something wrong, hm? Say it, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nRight out of your own mouth, as if bidding her\nfarewell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664488"
msgid "\"Those claws damage whatever they touch.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664532"
msgid "I can't comment on #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's personality.\nLike anyone, she has good aspects and bad aspects."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664644"
msgid "But there is this one thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664676"
msgid "There's no doubt that all those claws\ncan do is hurt people.\nUnless she can take them off, I can't speak to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664792"
msgid "She was on the verge of tears,\nbut her face transforms into that\nof an expressionless Noh mask."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664888"
msgid "I can no longer see any human-like\nemotion in #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664972"
msgid "#C236196003Lip#CDEF curiously peers at her own hands.\nShe speaks as if what she sees are normal arms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665076"
msgid "It reminds of the fable, \"The Emperor's New Clothes.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665132"
msgid "That's what #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF was made to be;\nan #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF made to only ever be rejected."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665248"
msgid "…I see… That's right.\nBecause I'm an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF…\nBecause I'm one of #C236196003BB#CDEF's parts…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665364"
msgid "You're tricking me with lies like\nthat, aren't you?\n…even though… I like you so much…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665456"
msgid "Even though I like you so much,\nI can't go on living without you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665524"
msgid "There's no more avoiding fights.\nThere's nowhere for #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF to run.\nThe only thing left to do is settle this now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665660"
msgid "So, you have love and hate flipped.\nI won't sneer at your earnestness. My love is\nin a form similar to yours, as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665780"
msgid "Only cherishing things you like―――\nThat's nothing but a reflection of narcissism."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665868"
msgid "To compel someone to serve you,\nyou exhaust them. You accept obligations to\nmake them obligated to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665972"
msgid "If you find out that it doesn't turn out that\nway, you turn them into a mute pebble\nand keep them for yourself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666084"
msgid "I've had enough of all this \"I like you,\nI like you.\" Have you ever once put in any\neffort to make yourself likeable?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666204"
msgid "―――Very well.\nAt last you've become human, it seems.\nI've been waiting for that hatred."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666296"
msgid "Love is not a beautiful thing.\nIt's ugly, irrational, and involves pain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666372"
msgid "However―――Your love is one-sided.\nLove is something you nurture together,\nand it changes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666468"
msgid "A love which desires only one's partner, a love\nwhich only begs to be desired, only achieves\nconsuming the life of one's companion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666600"
msgid "Taking away even the freedom of those who\ndistanced themselves from you is nothing short\nof an evil obsession."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666712"
msgid "True love is about give-and-take. Just feeling\nisn't enough. The unselfish would say\nthat you're IN love, but not loving."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666836"
msgid "And that's why what is born from within that\nbecomes a light, which anyone would\nfind difficult to alter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666944"
msgid "Love and hate must be a fabric woven of both.\nWhat truth is there in saying there exists\nbeauty which births only beautiful things?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667076"
msgid "I shall teach you that lesson.\nCome at me, #RUBS      Alter Ego#RUBElittle fraction#REND.\nI'll put an end to your suffering!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667204"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF, #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF.\nBefore we settle this, I'll throw you\njust one question: is your love genuine?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667340"
msgid "Your liking is still only on that level.\nGo milk those brea― I mean, dust yourself off\nand try again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667444"
msgid "…though, I guess that's the reason why I\nsympathize, or maybe, admire you. If you weren't\nafter my Darling, I might be cheering you on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667584"
msgid "Therefore, the king himself shall teach this:\nwhatever the endeavor, fundamentally, it's a\nbattle. Everything has assailants and victims."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667724"
msgid "If you wish to achieve your lifelong dream,\nthen kill me, and make #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF yours.\nThat's all your madness is capable of!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667864"
msgid "But… Even if an AI wanted to die, they can't.\nThat's why…\nThat's why……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667940"
msgid "Yes, that's the best way…!\nIf only you never existed… Everything would've\nbeen fine if you never existed…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668052"
msgid "The first secret that makes up #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF:\nthe special, unique function bestowed only unto her―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "668172"
msgid "10 nailed claws"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668188"
msgid "Damn, I got it wrong…\nSure, those claws are one of #C236196003Lip#CDEF's defining features,\nbut they're no #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668316"
msgid "The feature of #C236196003Lip#CDEF's body that best represents her is\nher―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668396"
msgid "Of course, this isn't the time to be doing this.\nI need to be going after her #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668496"
msgid "The skin touching my hand belongs to a maiden.\nAware that she doesn't like that,\nmaybe I was being intentionally rough with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668628"
msgid "Um, um… I feel embarrassed.\nI feel your breath on me, it's hot,\nand it hurts… mm…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668716"
msgid "I can't do that.\nNow that I'm set on exposing her mind,\nI'm going to drive her right up against the wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668824"
msgid "I recklessly insert my hand into her cleavage.\nMy fingertips touch a number of cubes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668912"
msgid "Deep cleavage. An information coffin.\nA treasure box that will never open, its contents all rotten."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669012"
msgid "#C000246204Breast Valley#CDEF.\nIt shows proof that she's no normal human――no normal maiden."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669108"
msgid "Without even writhing around, #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF simply bears it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669184"
msgid "It hurts, don't…\nIt's embarrassing, I don't like it…\nAh, mm, ahh!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669252"
msgid "Ah, d-don't―――DON'T―――!\nYou'll fall―――you're going to fall into\n#RUBS     me  #RUBEmy valley#REND at this rate, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669400"
msgid "That was close. #C236196003Lip#CDEF calling out to me brought me\nback to my senses. If she hadn't restrained me with her voice,\nI would've probably slipped into her #C000246204Breast Valley#CDEF\nand turned into a living lump of flesh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669636"
msgid "I slowly release my fingers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669668"
msgid "She slowly lifts up her weak, downcast eyes.\nMaybe she was biting her lip while bearing it,\nas it almost looks like she has lipstick on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669808"
msgid "You're stopping, aren't you…\nI'm glad…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669852"
msgid "I get shivers from hearing the disparity\nbetween her words and her seemingly lonely voice."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "669944"
msgid "Masochistic Constitution"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "669972"
msgid "Desire to be restrained"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669996"
msgid "She sees herself as a monster,\nshe blocks herself off with her colossal claws―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670080"
msgid "Is the reason why she never has any self-confidence\nand is so self-depreciating because\nshe wants to be locked away…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670200"
msgid "Sure, she may give off a strong image of being restrained,\nbut that's not what she's about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670292"
msgid "My words become a blade that tears through #C236196003Lip#CDEF's mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670364"
msgid "#C000246204Masochistic Constitution#CDEF.\nIt's an #C000246204SG#CDEF that makes her target irrational,\nbeckoning them to act sadistically towards #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670540"
msgid "I also don't like, being alone, but―――\nStill, when someone, comes near,\nI get scared…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670632"
msgid "I mean, when I'm touched… umm…\nMy body, starts, hurting…\n…starts, getting hot…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670716"
msgid "…I feel sorry for her, but that's wrong.\n#C236196003Lip#CDEF is also at fault here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670804"
msgid "That's her third #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThe nectar that causes one to lose their\nreason after being invited in by her #C000246204Masochistic Constitution#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670964"
msgid "Which is to say, her―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "670992"
msgid "Hypersensitivity"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671012"
msgid "Uhh, umm…\nI'm going to get to squashing you now, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671068"
msgid "…I messed up…\nLooks like I'm still not in my right state of mind…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671140"
msgid "#C000246204Hypersensitivity#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671176"
msgid "Even if they had no intention to,\nher highly-sensitive body means\nthey would end up hurting #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671296"
msgid "With her hands, meant to touch things, as grotesque claws;\nwith skin as frail as light snowfall to the touch,\nit's difficult to socialize with others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671448"
msgid "Her hands are supposed to match the other's force,\nbut they flatten and crush anything and everything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671552"
msgid "That's everything about this #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671608"
msgid "She's none other than an incarnation of lust,\nsaying all those things to avert her eyes\nfrom her own sins―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671724"
msgid "…she's wrong.\nThose claws aren't the only thing monster-like about her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671800"
msgid "She crushes those who don't live up to her expectations.\nShe mercilessly makes anything she doesn't need disappear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671916"
msgid "I like #C236196003#NICK#CDEF… That's really all\nthere is to it… I want you, to stay by me,\neven if only for a little while…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672044"
msgid "So… I thought about getting rid of anyone\nwho got between us… That's all,\nwhat's wrong with that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672148"
msgid "You're saying that's selfish?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672180"
msgid "…this is bad, we're going nowhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672220"
msgid "There's no point in giving #C236196003Lip#CDEF half-baked arguments.\nI need to clearly and fully reject her…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672332"
msgid "#C236196003Lip#CDEF talked about getting rid of everyone\nwho gets in her way―\"that's it.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672424"
msgid "Regardless of what kind of relationship it is,\nrelationships between people shape our personality.\n#C236196003Lip#CDEF, who doesn't understand that, can't relate with others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672600"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is simply trying to be all alone.\nShe's an enemy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672680"
msgid "Ah, ah―――\nNo, you've got it wrong, I was lying,\nwhat I just said, was a lie…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672764"
msgid "I won't do something, like kill you.\n…I can't, do something like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672836"
msgid "I'll cherish you, cherish you…\nMy thoughts, along with the kind\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672928"
msgid "I'll just squeeze you… tight,\nand put you deep into my breasts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672996"
msgid "…this is bad, we're going nowhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673036"
msgid "There's no point in giving #C236196003Lip#CDEF half-baked arguments.\nI need to clearly and fully reject her…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673148"
msgid "NOO!\nIt hurts, it hurts, it hurts, it hurts!\nWhy are you saying that to me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673228"
msgid "Our goal is to escape the Far Side.\nI have no intention of staying in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF\nor inside #C236196003Lip#CDEF's mind any longer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673384"
msgid "You'd be safe if you stay here, and yet…\nI would be together with you,\nforever, and yet…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673476"
msgid "Even though I love you, so much…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673512"
msgid "#C236196003Lip#CDEF's mind is in shambles at this point.\nOne more hit, and her mind will probably collapse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673620"
msgid "…still, I need to deliver the final blow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673664"
msgid "The reason why is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673688"
msgid "It hurts… It, hurts…\nNot that, people deny me… It's that you,\nsaid that to me, which makes me, sad…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673792"
msgid "Is it, true…?\nThis isn't love… and here I thought,\nfinally, I had understood―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673880"
msgid "We know, everything about each other…\nThere's no longer, anything left\nto talk about…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673968"
msgid "Just think of me, as cute.\nThen there's no need,\nto think of anything else…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674048"
msgid "I don't get it.\nI don't understand.\nEven though it hurts so much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674116"
msgid "When I look, at your pained face,\nI get sad, from the bottom of my heart―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674196"
msgid "It makes no sense, to me.\nIt must be―――that AI, are made so that they\ncan't understand love―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674300"
msgid "…I'm sorry, for causing you to put on\nthat face. I'm sorry, for saying such horrible\nthings to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674404"
msgid "#C080080080Leaving behind lonely muttering,#CDEF #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF#C080080080 disappears.\nOr maybe, this illusion in the form of a girl disappears.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674568"
msgid "#C080080080Is she a creature that must not exist,\nor was there some answer to all this―――?#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674668"
msgid "#C080080080I'll never know what that answer was.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674724"
msgid "…no. I have no more need of hearing your\nvoice, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF… since I\nhave no idea what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674848"
msgid "I like you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF. I like you.\nI don't want, to do any more, bad things,\nto the #C236196003#NICK#CDEF I love…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674976"
msgid "The density of this space transforms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675016"
msgid "The muttered whimpers cease;\nI hear only the echo of her clattering claws."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675092"
msgid "You don't need things like a voice, or a mind.\nWhat's not needed, I'll crush and throw away.\nSo long as there's still love left."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675224"
msgid "That must be what my love is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675256"
msgid "What I want to embrace with these hands is…\nWhat I want to hold tight and forever\nclose to me is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675356"
msgid "I yell out, \"don't do anything stupid,\"\nbut my voice doesn't reach #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675452"
msgid "And I can't run.\nThis is the inside of #C236196003Lip#CDEF's mind.\nThere was never anywhere for me to run."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675560"
msgid "Are you scared, of my love?\nAhh, I see. You must be afraid because\nyou don't know what it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675656"
msgid "From here on, forever, and ever.\nFor all eternity.\nUntil death divides the two apart―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675748"
msgid "This is proof that #C236196003Lip#CDEF's mind has completely awakened."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675820"
msgid "Though it looks like she has some spare energy,\nshe probably won't be able to fight anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675916"
msgid "What will you do, Praetor?\nShe's an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF. Different from a human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676004"
msgid "…now that I think about it, this is tricky.\nIf you don't free her mind, we won't be able to\nleave this place. But, she IS an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676160"
msgid "Okie dokie, it's punishment time! Again!\nHuh? This time, it's for an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF?\nNot a human?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676272"
msgid "This is a good time to show your worth\nas a #[man][woman]#, isn't it, mongrel?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676352"
msgid "Like you did with #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\nwill you lay her mind bare?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676444"
msgid "Is it really okay to expose her mind,\nlike with humans?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676500"
msgid "Will you scatter this flower or show it mercy?\nChoose as you see fit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676572"
msgid "…in any case, we won't be able to\nbreak out of #C236196003Lip#CDEF's mind at this rate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676664"
msgid "Even if I'm facing an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF, no,\nBECAUSE she's an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF,\nI have to completely incapacitate her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676800"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF has totally isolated\nherself from the outside.\nI step towards her defenseless body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676912"
msgid "I don't think she'll go swinging those claws around,\nbut it doesn't change how terrifying they are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677012"
msgid "While keeping an eye on #C236196003Lip#CDEF's brutal hands,\nI close the distance between us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677108"
msgid "Though an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF's mind may be more\ndangerous than a human's,\nI can't turn back now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677212"
msgid "It's time to finish this…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677240"
msgid "This is the depths of her mind.\nEven within her Id, the core of her mental image,\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is always crying."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677368"
msgid "…you're scaring me. Even you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF…\nYou're going to bully me, aren't you…\nYou're, mean…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677480"
msgid "Though her slender body is very frail,\nher extremely soft-looking chest and\nthose brutal claws make for a strange presence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677604"
msgid "Her bobbing breasts naturally draw one's gaze."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677652"
msgid "Now that it's come to this,\nall I can do is keep moving until the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677728"
msgid "An #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF is different from #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677824"
msgid "Which means―――it's not that I have\nto unravel her mind, but rather,\ncompletely defeat her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677920"
msgid "I myself don't understand the reason why.\nI just feel, anything but that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677996"
msgid "A recently born \"mind\" isn't something to expose,\nit's something to watch over―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678084"
msgid "I'm… going to disappear, aren't I…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678124"
msgid "I don't understand the reason,\nwhy people were afraid of me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678188"
msgid "…I don't understand what \"love\" is.\nAll I know is what I really like, really hate,\nand pain…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678284"
msgid "I don't want to… disappear…\nI want you, to tell me…\nBeing alone, in the end… scares me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678380"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF has lost her strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678432"
msgid "If we don't strike her down for good now, she may recover.\nMore importantly, we won't be able to move forward―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678548"
msgid "Don't show her any mercy, Praetor.\nThere must be retribution for a crime."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678624"
msgid "Her crime was that she only saw her own terror\nand didn't consider it in others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678708"
msgid "Wild animals and people can't enter the same\ncage. No matter how attached an animal is to a\nperson, the slightest slip-up leads to death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678848"
msgid "Disregarding poetic justice is what makes\nyou great, Darling. But in this instance,\nthat's not good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678952"
msgid "I see, you won't expose her mind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678988"
msgid "Even worse, an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF is an AI.\nFundamentally, they weren't created to be\ncapable of understand human emotion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679120"
msgid "An #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF is an AI that was born\n\"in such a way.\" There will never come a time\nwhen they understand what love is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679256"
msgid "Then what will you do next?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679284"
msgid "Please bear in mind that she wants love, but has\nthe misfortune of being unable to attain it.\nThe just thing to do is to have this girl go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679424"
msgid "In the end, there's something,\nI still don't know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679476"
msgid "Ending with a lonesome murmur, #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF vanishes.\nOr perhaps, the illusion in the form\nof a young girl disappears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679612"
msgid "Maybe she was a forbidden existence,\nor maybe there was some solution to all this―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679700"
msgid "But, her face looks just like #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's,\nand I wasn't able to personally do anything\nto help her despite how lonely she seems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679844"
msgid "However, we have to keep in mind that\n#C236196003BB#CDEF is the mastermind here.\nI want to believe that the fate of her\nhunters isn't really that important."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680004"
msgid "…I see… Even if you don't like me,\nyou'll still be nice to me, right…?\nThat's the paradox of… the mind of a human…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680124"
msgid "This feeling of happiness, at least…\nis definitely my real heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680192"
msgid "…I lose strength across my entire body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680236"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF was defeated, and I used up all my magical energy.\nI can't even lift a single finger now…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680348"
msgid "We'll never be apart again…\nPlease become a cube, through and through,\nin the palm of my hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680444"
msgid "It's just that, it narrowed, extremely, is all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680492"
msgid "My limbs are tightly glued to my body.\nMy head, my torso, my back; everything\nhas joined into one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680592"
msgid "I fell into an abyss where not a\nsingle ray of light shines."
msgstr ""

